From gallatin at cs.duke.edu  Fri May 30 06:35:55 2003
From: gallatin at cs.duke.edu (Andrew Gallatin)
Date: Fri May 30 06:38:27 2003
Subject: 5.1 Beta 2 Kernel Panic on AlphaServer 2100
In-Reply-To: <3ED71C55.30864.8AC308@localhost>
References: <3ED71C55.30864.8AC308@localhost>
Message-ID: <16087.24115.220092.406102@grasshopper.cs.duke.edu>


What disks are in this box and how are they labeled?  You can
use tru64 to tell you this.

There's some bug somewhere that causes this panic to happen if you
have a poorly labeled disk.  I think linux disks most frequently 
trigger it.

Drew
